Provenance and Interoperability Notice:
  This package is an independent, clean-room C++20 implementation based on
  observable QuickTime/ISOBMFF NRAW container structures, TIFF-EP / Nikon
  HE/HE* SubIFD layouts, ISO/IEC 21122 (JPEG XS) / TicoRAW R0 codestream
  mathematics, Sony ARW6 (Compressed HQ / Compressed, Compression=32766)
  multi-tile strip and "A000" wavelet structures, and DNG 1.4 specifications.
  Format identifiers, camera color matrices, and fourcc tags appear solely for
  format interoperability.

